-- The manifest of the first Gabbro process without a C library (C-free lane, C1).
--
-- `nolibc` is the whole difference to `63-druckt.bau`: no libc is linked, `_start` is
-- generated, and the compiler line must say `-ffreestanding` (the build refuses it
-- otherwise) -- and `-fno-stack-protector`, whose runtime is libc's too.
compiler cc -std=c11 -O0 -ffreestanding -fno-stack-protector -fno-pie -Wall -Wextra -Werror
out      target/bau-ohne-libc
nolibc

unit prozess program
    beispiele/172-prozess-ohne-libc.gab
